{"id":"9952d6b6a8f8b771","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation.md","title":"ZFC Fun Sequence Concatenation","display":"df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation — ZFC Fun Sequence Concatenation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation — ZFC Fun Sequence Concatenation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation — ZFC Fun Sequence Concatenation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d74493bfaf9bf48a\" href=\"?note=d74493bfaf9bf48a\" title=\"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic\">58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in V\">\\(s,t,u\\in V\\)</span> (two input function graphs and a concatenation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span> (ordinal lengths)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (common codomain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> (ordinal addition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d74493bfaf9bf48a\" href=\"?note=d74493bfaf9bf48a\" title=\"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic\">58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S\\)</span> (ordinal-sequence concatenation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S(u,s,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\alpha,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\alpha+\\beta,X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\alpha\\;u(i)=s(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in\\beta\\;u(\\alpha+j)=t(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S(u,s,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\alpha,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\alpha+\\beta,X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\alpha\\;u(i)=s(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in\\beta\\;u(\\alpha+j)=t(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$+$ (ordinal addition, see [[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,t,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunSequenceConcatenation}_S(u,s,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\alpha,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(t,\\beta,X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(u,\\alpha+\\beta,X)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in\\alpha\\;u(i)=s(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in\\beta\\;u(\\alpha+j)=t(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1410,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation.md|58-df-zfc-fun-sequence-concatenation]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","d74493bfaf9bf48a"]}